        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>北纬修补所｜修鞋与配钥匙</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --paper: #2C3034;\n      --ink: #EBEEF0;\n      --ink-mid: #C2C8CD;\n      --ink-soft: #A8AFB5;\n      --rule: #6E767C;\n      --paper-lift: #33383D;\n      --serif: \"Noto Serif SC\", Literata, Georgia, serif;\n      --sans: Jost, \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      --mono: \"Sometype Mono\", monospace;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html {\n      background: var(--paper);\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background: var(--paper);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: var(--serif);\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    a {\n      color: inherit;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .archive {\n      width: min(1440px, 100%);\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 28px 5vw 30px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .masthead {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      padding-bottom: 18px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      color: var(--ink-mid);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .masthead strong {\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .issue {\n      font-family: var(--mono);\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      text-align: right;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      position: relative;\n      padding: 34px 0 30px;\n      max-width: 1120px;\n    }\n\n    .kicker {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      letter-spacing: .13em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      max-width: 940px;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 6.75rem);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: -.075em;\n      line-height: .91;\n    }\n\n    .hero-note {\n      max-width: 650px;\n      margin: 23px 0 0;\n      color: var(--ink-mid);\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .hero-note em {\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-style: normal;\n    }\n\n    .index {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 31px;\n      width: 104px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding-top: 7px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: var(--mono);\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      text-align: right;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    }\n\n    .entries {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .82fr 1.25fr .86fr 1fr;\n      gap: 18px;\n      align-items: start;\n      padding: 7px 0 28px;\n    }\n\n    .entry {\n      --indent: 0%;\n      --gap: 0px;\n      min-width: 0;\n      margin-left: var(--indent);\n      padding-top: var(--gap);\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(1) {\n      --indent: 0%;\n      --gap: 98px;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(2) {\n      --indent: 3%;\n      --gap: 58px;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(3) {\n      --indent: 5.5%;\n      --gap: 72px;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(4) {\n      --indent: 2%;\n      --gap: 0px;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(5) {\n      --indent: 7%;\n      --gap: 58px;\n      margin-right: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .entry-number {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: var(--mono);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      letter-spacing: .03em;\n    }\n\n    .entry h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.3vw, 2.15rem);\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: -.045em;\n      line-height: 1.06;\n    }\n\n    .entry p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink-mid);\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n\n    .entry p + p {\n      margin-top: 11px;\n    }\n\n    .service-list,\n    .hours {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      list-style: none;\n    }\n\n    .service-list li,\n    .hours li {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 7px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-lift);\n      color: var(--ink-mid);\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .service-list li:first-child,\n    .hours li:first-child {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-lift);\n    }\n\n    .price,\n    .time {\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: var(--mono);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    .appointment {\n      background: var(--paper-lift);\n      padding: 15px 16px 17px;\n    }\n\n    .appointment h2 {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .phone {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-top: 17px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--ink-mid);\n      padding: 9px 12px 8px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: var(--mono);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      letter-spacing: .02em;\n      transition: border-color 180ms linear;\n    }\n\n    .phone:hover,\n    .phone:focus-visible {\n      border-color: var(--rule);\n      outline: none;\n    }\n\n    .location-mark {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 27px;\n      height: 1px;\n      margin: 0 8px 5px 0;\n      background: var(--ink-soft);\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      gap: 24px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding-top: 12px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: var(--sans);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n    }\n\n    .footer p {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .footer .folio {\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: var(--mono);\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    @media (min-width: 760px) {\n      .js-ready .entry {\n        opacity: 0;\n        animation: appear 300ms linear forwards;\n        animation-delay: calc((var(--n) * 26ms) + var(--text-delay));\n      }\n    }\n\n    @keyframes appear {\n      from { opacity: 0; }\n      to { opacity: 1; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 980px) {\n      .entries {\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n        row-gap: 0;\n      }\n\n      .entry:nth-child(1) {\n        grid-column: span 2;\n      }\n\n      .entry:nth-child(3) {\n        grid-column: span 2;\n      }\n\n      .entry:nth-child(5) {\n        grid-column: span 2;\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 759px) {\n      .archive {\n        padding: 20px 22px 24px;\n      }\n\n      .masthead {\n        font-size: 10px;\n      }\n\n      .hero {\n        padding: 30px 0 26px;\n      }\n\n      h1 {\n        font-size: clamp(4rem, 18vw, 6.4rem);\n      }\n\n      .hero-note {\n        font-size: 17px;\n      }\n\n      .index {\n        position: static;\n        margin-top: 25px;\n        width: 100%;\n        text-align: left;\n      }\n\n      .entries {\n        display: block;\n        padding-top: 0;\n      }\n\n      .entry,\n      .entry:nth-child(1),\n      .entry:nth-child(2),\n      .entry:nth-child(3),\n      .entry:nth-child(4),\n      .entry:nth-child(5) {\n        margin-right: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 28px;\n        padding-top: 22px;\n      }\n\n      .entry:nth-child(1) { margin-left: 0; }\n      .entry:nth-child(2) { margin-left: 3%; }\n      .entry:nth-child(3) { margin-left: 5.5%; }\n      .entry:nth-child(4) { margin-left: 2%; }\n      .entry:nth-child(5) { margin-left: 7%; }\n\n      .footer {\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 7px;\n      }\n\n      .footer .folio {\n        text-align: left;\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      .entry,\n      .js-ready .entry {\n        opacity: 1;\n        animation: none;\n      }\n\n      .entries .entry:nth-child(1) { padding-top: 104px; }\n      .entries .entry:nth-child(2) { padding-top: 96px; }\n      .entries .entry:nth-child(3) { padding-top: 112px; }\n      .entries .entry:nth-child(4) { padding-top: 88px; }\n      .entries .entry:nth-child(5) { padding-top: 120px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"archive\">\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <div><strong>北纬修补所</strong> / 鞋履修复・钥匙复制</div>\n      <div class=\"issue\">FIELD NOTE 05<br>LOCAL SERVICE INDEX</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"page-title\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">一份关于日常物件继续使用的记录</p>\n      <h1 id=\"page-title\">请把<br>旧物带来。</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-note\">\n        我们处理鞋底、鞋跟、拉链与钥匙。<em>不替换生活，只让它继续。</em>\n        来店前打电话，我们会为你留出一段不被催促的时间。\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"index\">INDEX / 05<br>REVISED 2024.06</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entries\" aria-label=\"服务索引\">\n      <article class=\"entry\" style=\"--n: 1; --text-delay: 18ms;\">\n        <span class=\"entry-number\">01 / 修复范围</span>\n        <h2>鞋履的<br>第二次使用</h2>\n        <p>鞋底磨薄、鞋跟倾斜、皮面开裂，都是可以被仔细处理的痕迹。我们先判断结构，再决定是否值得修。</p>\n        <p>常规项目不追求变新，只追求走路时重新可靠。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\" style=\"--n: 2; --text-delay: 34ms;\">\n        <span class=\"entry-number\">02 / 配钥匙</span>\n        <h2>复制一把<br>准确的钥匙</h2>\n        <ul class=\"service-list\">\n          <li><span>家用门钥匙</span><span class=\"price\">15—35</span></li>\n          <li><span>防盗门钥匙</span><span class=\"price\">30—80</span></li>\n          <li><span>特殊胚钥匙</span><span class=\"price\">询价</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>价格以钥匙胚与齿形为准，现场确认后开始制作。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry appointment\" style=\"--n: 3; --text-delay: 8ms;\">\n        <span class=\"entry-number\">03 / 预约办法</span>\n        <h2>先来一通<br>电话。</h2>\n        <p>请告诉我物件是什么、哪里需要处理，以及你希望来的时间。复杂修复可以先描述，不必急着带来。</p>\n        <a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:021-6288-2716\">021—6288—2716</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\" style=\"--n: 4; --text-delay: 27ms;\">\n        <span class=\"entry-number\">04 / 开放时间</span>\n        <h2>门会在<br>这些时刻开着</h2>\n        <ul class=\"hours\">\n          <li><span>周一至周五</span><span class=\"time\">09:30—18:30</span></li>\n          <li><span>周六</span><span class=\"time\">10:00—17:00</span></li>\n          <li><span>周日</span><span class=\"time\">休息</span></li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>午间不闭店。临时变更会在电话中说明。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\" style=\"--n: 5; --text-delay: 40ms;\">\n        <span class=\"entry-number\">05 / 来店地址</span>\n        <h2>在街角，<br>不难找到。</h2>\n        <p><span class=\"location-mark\"></span>上海市静安区常德路 218 号，近昌平路。</p>\n        <p>门面不大，蓝灰色门牌写着“北纬修补所”。如果你已经走到街角，请打电话，我们会出来找你。</p>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <p>下一期什么时候：等一双鞋再次走远以后。</p>\n      <p class=\"folio\">S34 / ZERO-PHOTO SERVICE INDEX</p>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      document.body.classList.add(\"js-ready\");\n    }());\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>"
        }
